WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:18,100
I've had mixed reviews of women taking flax seeds or flax seed oil with horrible and positive breast cancer, what's your opinion?

00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:22,100
I would agree there are mixed reviews out there.

00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:35,100
I followed in the camp of no because there's too much data that flax seeds and flax seed oil is estrogenic.

00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,100
And we don't want that.

00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:45,100
So I would fall into the no category on that.

00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:57,100
If we have other people that have different cancers and they're using flax seed oil or they're using the blood weight protocol which is flax seed oil, but they don't have ER positive cancer.

00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:02,100
So if you have hormone positive cancer, then I would say no.

